  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is pursuant to the need to include water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) as an urgent and complementary need in UN&#x2019;s overall support to disaster prone communities in the three northern regions of Ghana. It also contributes to the need for coherent vision and collective programming that the UN system seeks to achieve, in delivering as one, in support of key priorities of the Government</narrative>
  </description>
